      "id": "8f93f35be40c25e0034155a81b1481e2f743b111f6c4b37352660c63dd55d87c",
      "title": "Haley Stevens’ stunning endorsement set off a media firestorm. Will Michigan voters care?",
      "url": "https://x.com/mehdirhasan/status/2116959181412630940",
      "category": "uncategorized",
      "checkedAt": "2026-11-16T11:18:13.387Z",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "finalUrl": "https://x.com/mehdirhasan/status/2116959181412630940",
      "contentType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
      "pageTitle": "Mehdi Hasan (@mehdirhasan) on X",
      "pageDescription": "She’s clearly a disturbed, deranged, dishonest woman (less than 48 hours ago she was swearing to the NYT she was backing Abdul) but the bigger question to ask is: how on earth did the Dem establishment put her forward as their candidate? A complete traitor to their party and now an enabler of Trump…",
